# Pulsar Framework — CODEOWNERS
#
# Per ADR-0007 + ADR-0008 sprint feature branch contract, every PR is reviewed
# under the /review skill, and the terminal develop -> main merge under
# /ultrareview. This file auto-assigns review on PRs.
#
# Solo-maintainer phase per Decision 2.48 + risk R-009: every path resolves to
# the maintainer. Per Section 2.48 + R-013/R-017 a second committer is
# pre-authorised at any checkpoint where solo velocity falls below sustainable
# target. When that happens, this file is updated to share ownership.
#
# Format: <pattern> <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Documentation: https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

